"Zotero 可关联本机数据目录，EndNote 使用 XML。关闭“导入时复制附件”后，将直接打开原始文件。PaperFocus 保存阅读状态与摘要，不改写外部文献库。" = "Zotero can be linked from its local data directory. EndNote uses XML. When attachment copying is off, original files are opened directly. PaperFocus stores reading state and summaries and does not modify the external library.";
"导入文献" = "Import library";
"导入方式" = "Import method";
