"PaperFocus 文献库" = "PaperFocus library";
"PDF 文件" = "PDF files";
"PDF 文件夹" = "PDF folder";
"将 Zotero 设为唯一关联文献库，并停用应用内文献库" = "Make Zotero the only linked library and turn off the in-app library";
"开启后，文献列表只显示 Zotero 文献，并暂停使用应用内文献库。已保存的应用内条目不会被删除。" = "When enabled, the library list shows only Zotero items and pauses the in-app library. Saved in-app items are not deleted.";
"选择其他位置…" = "Choose another location…";
"关联所选文献库" = "Link selected library";
