"关联 Zotero 账户" = "Link Zotero account";
"在 Zotero 网站创建 API 密钥后填入。密钥仅保存在本机。" = "Create an API key on the Zotero website and enter it here. The key is stored only on this Mac.";
"未在默认位置找到 Zotero 文献库。请选择数据目录或 zotero.sqlite。" = "No Zotero library was found in the default locations. Choose a data directory or zotero.sqlite.";
"所选位置" = "Selected location";
"找到多个 Zotero 文献库。请选择其一，或指定其他位置。" = "Several Zotero libraries were found. Choose one, or specify another location.";
"已在本机找到 Zotero 文献库。请确认要关联的位置。" = "A Zotero library was found on this Mac. Confirm the location to link.";
"将在默认数据目录和 Zotero 配置目录中查找文献库。" = "PaperFocus looks in the default data directory and Zotero profile locations.";
"请选择 EndNote 导出的 XML 文件。其他 XML 或 EndNote 程序库文件不会被导入。" = "Choose an EndNote XML export. Other XML files and EndNote library packages are not imported.";
"请选择 PaperFocus 文献库数据库或 paperfocus.library 文件。格式不符时不会替换当前文献库。" = "Choose a PaperFocus library database or a paperfocus.library file. A file that does not match is not opened, and the current library stays in place.";
"可以选择一个或多个 PDF 文件。" = "You can choose one or more PDF files.";
"请选择包含 PDF 的文件夹。" = "Choose a folder that contains PDFs.";
"当前设置为在导入时复制附件。" = "Attachments are currently copied during import.";
"当前设置为直接使用原始文件，不会生成副本。可在设置中更改。" = "Original files are used directly and are not copied. You can change this in Settings.";
"已导入所选 PDF。" = "The selected PDFs were imported.";
"已导入 Zotero JSON。该文件不是可继续同步的本地数据库。" = "The Zotero JSON file was imported. It is not a local database that can stay in sync.";
"找到多个 Zotero 文献库。请在导入时选择要关联的文献库。" = "Several Zotero libraries were found. Choose which library to link when importing.";
"现有文献库文件不是 PaperFocus 文献库，因此未打开。当前文献库保持不变。" = "The existing library file is not a PaperFocus library, so it was not opened. The current library was left unchanged.";
"无法识别该文献库格式。请选择 Zotero 数据目录、Zotero JSON、EndNote XML 或 PaperFocus 文献库。" = "This library format is not recognized. Choose a Zotero data directory, Zotero JSON, EndNote XML, or a PaperFocus library.";
"无法识别 Zotero 文献库。请选择包含有效 zotero.sqlite 的数据目录。该数据库需要具备 Zotero 的表结构，不能是其他 SQLite 文件。" = "This is not a Zotero library. Choose a data directory that contains a valid zotero.sqlite file with the Zotero schema, not another SQLite database.";
"无法识别 EndNote 文献库。请选择 EndNote 导出的 XML 文件，而不是其他 XML 或文件夹。" = "This is not an EndNote library PaperFocus can read. Choose an EndNote XML export, not another XML file or a folder.";
"所选文件是 EndNote 程序库，不是 PaperFocus 可读取的 EndNote XML。请在 EndNote 中导出 XML 后再导入。" = "This file is an EndNote library package, not the EndNote XML format PaperFocus reads. Export XML from EndNote and import that file.";
"所选内容不是 PaperFocus 文献库。请选择 PaperFocus 数据库或 paperfocus.library 文件。" = "This is not a PaperFocus library. Choose a PaperFocus database or a paperfocus.library file.";
"所选文件是当前正在使用的 PaperFocus 文献库，未重复导入。" = "This file is the PaperFocus library already in use, so it was not imported again.";
"已断开 Zotero 文献库关联。" = "The Zotero library was disconnected.";
"已断开 Zotero 文献库关联。已导入的文献记录会保留，但不再继续同步。" = "The Zotero library was disconnected. Imported records remain, but they will no longer sync.";
"已停用应用内文献库。请关联 Zotero 文献库后查看条目。" = "The in-app library is turned off. Link a Zotero library to view its items.";
"当前还没有文献。请使用导入按钮选择 PDF、Zotero、EndNote 或 PaperFocus 文献库。" = "There are no items yet. Use Import to choose PDFs, a Zotero library, EndNote XML, or a PaperFocus library.";
"还没有文献。请从文献库导入 PDF 或外部文献库。" = "There are no items yet. Import PDFs or an external library from the library.";
"可将 PDF、Zotero 文献库、EndNote XML 或 PaperFocus 文献库拖入此处。" = "Drop PDFs, a Zotero library, EndNote XML, or a PaperFocus library here.";
